<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Mutual to invest 200-300 bln yen in bonds.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Mutual to invest 200-300 bln yen in bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Mutual Life Insurance Co plans a combined total of 200 to 300 billion yen worth of fresh investment in foreign and domestic bonds in fiscal year 1997/98, which started on April 1, a company official said on Monday.</p>
<p>He also said that the company plans to reduce the proportion of equity holdings in its portfolio during this fiscal year.</p>
</text>
